  "changelog": "- Initial release of the skill for 1688 \u5546\u5bb6\u91cd\u70b9\u54c1\u5708\u9009 (1688-item-selection).\n- Supports intelligent identification and layered scoring of key products based on five dimensions: sales contribution, traffic efficiency, growth potential, marketing ROI, and product health.\n- Provides CLI commands to retrieve shop data, product overview, comprehensive product scoring and selection, and keyword-based product search.\n- Enforces output of product lists without displaying scores or optimization actions; recommendations are limited (default 3, user-selectable 1\u201310).\n- Integrates interactive table selection components for multi-product scenarios, enhancing user experience.\n- Includes robust error handling and safety guidelines; only performs read-only operations, with clear environmental and output format specifications.",
